        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Flame &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Furnace Veins</p><p><em>Glowing red veins; cracks of internal fire that open wider as the fight goes on.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Your Carapace Strikes may deal <strong>fire</strong> instead of their normal damage type. You shed dim light in a 10-foot radius and cannot suppress it.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><strong>+1d4 fire.</strong> On a critical hit, <strong>1d4 persistent fire</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><strong>+1d6 fire.</strong> Fire damage you deal treats fire resistance as <strong>5 lower</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><strong>+1d6 fire.</strong> On a critical hit, <strong>2d10 persistent fire</strong>, and the target's space burns &mdash; a creature ending its turn there takes 1d6 fire.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. Depth 3 and 4 switch off while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
